WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:04.571
-President Trump is demanding
an investigation

00:00:04.571 --> 00:00:06.739
into last week's
anonymous op-ed warning

00:00:06.739 --> 00:00:08.041
about his mental fitness

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:10.076
and slamming
the author of a new book

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:11.611
about the chaos
in his White House.

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:13.580
For more on this, it's time
for "A Closer Look."

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:17.917
[ Applause ]

00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:22.021
One of the weirdest aspects of
having Donald Trump as President

00:00:22.021 --> 00:00:24.090
is the fact that every few
months or so,

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:26.593
people working at
the highest levels of government

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:28.695
have to put down everything
they're doing

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:31.797
and hunt for the anonymous mole
who just called

00:00:31.797 --> 00:00:34.133
the President
a brain-dead moron.

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:35.568
Same thing over and over.

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:37.736
Someone calls the President
an idiot

00:00:37.736 --> 00:00:39.472
or they call him a fifth grader

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:43.009
or they leak a transcript of him
telling the President of Mexico

00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:45.111
he wants a piñata
for his birthday.

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:47.346
And then serious government
officials

00:00:47.346 --> 00:00:49.015
and four-star generals have to

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:52.118
issue so many denials,
they start to sound like Shaggy.

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:53.686
-♪ It wasn't me ♪

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:55.855
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:57.256
-And sure enough...

00:00:57.256 --> 00:01:00.226
sure enough, the government is
once again

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:02.729
grinding to a halt
as the President demands

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:06.165
that the Attorney General use
actual law-enforcement resources

00:01:06.165 --> 00:01:08.601
to investigate who wrote last
week's anonymous op-ed

00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:09.736
in "The New York Times."

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:11.671 line:0%
-President Trump is now
calling

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:14.340 line:0%
on Attorney General
Jeff Sessions to track down

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.908 line:0%
that unnamed senior official

00:01:15.908 --> 00:01:18.611 line:0%
behind that scathing
"New York Times" editorial.

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:44.370
-He sounds like Sherlock Holmes
after a concussion.

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.672
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.672 --> 00:01:48.007
[ As President Trump ]
My dear Watson,

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:49.475
we're going to find out
who the suspect is,

00:01:49.475 --> 00:01:51.944
and where he is,
and what he did,

00:01:51.944 --> 00:01:54.047
and who he what,
and why I where.

00:01:54.047 --> 00:01:57.584
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.584 --> 00:01:59.752
[ Normal voice ]
Trump apparently thinks

00:01:59.752 --> 00:02:01.354
a crime might have been
committed

00:02:01.354 --> 00:02:02.555
by whoever wrote the op-ed.

00:02:02.555 --> 00:02:05.191
Yesterday White House counselor
Kellyanne Conway

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:07.793
was asked on CNN what exactly
that crime may be

00:02:07.793 --> 00:02:09.161
and didn't have an answer.

00:02:09.161 --> 00:02:10.963 line:0%
-President Trump has said that
Jeff Sessions,

00:02:10.963 --> 00:02:12.732 line:0%
the Attorney General should be
investigating

00:02:12.732 --> 00:02:14.500 line:0%
who the author of the piece is

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:16.803 line:0%
because of national
security reasons.

00:02:16.803 --> 00:02:19.372 line:0%
Is that a directive to DOJ
to investigate?

00:02:19.372 --> 00:02:21.641 line:0%
-From what I understand, there
can be an investigation

00:02:21.641 --> 00:02:23.309 line:0%
if there's criminal activity
perhaps.

00:02:23.309 --> 00:02:24.643 line:0%
-There doesn't appear to be any.

00:02:24.643 --> 00:02:26.846 line:0%
-I don't know that, and I don't
think you know that.

00:02:26.846 --> 00:02:28.514 line:0%
-What would the criminal
activity be?

00:02:28.514 --> 00:02:29.882 line:0%
-It really depends

00:02:29.882 --> 00:02:31.417 line:0%
on what else has been divulged
by an individual.

00:02:31.417 --> 00:02:32.618 line:0%
Anybody who would do this --

00:02:32.618 --> 00:02:34.120 line:0%
-But we read the op-ed.

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:36.122 line:0%
There was nothing -- There are
no national secrets divulged.

00:02:36.122 --> 00:02:37.257 line:0%
-Anybody who would do this,

00:02:37.257 --> 00:02:39.025 line:0%
you don't know what else
they're saying.

00:02:39.025 --> 00:02:40.659 line:0%
-You think the person
broke the law?

00:02:40.659 --> 00:02:42.061 line:0%
-I don't know.
I have no idea.

00:02:42.061 --> 00:02:44.030 line:0%
-You think because he or she
wrote the op-ed,

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:47.400 line:0%
he or she might have also
broken the law?

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:50.369 line:0%
-I have really no idea,
nor do you.

00:02:50.369 --> 00:02:51.604
-Yeah, we do.

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:54.740
We do because
we all read the op-ed.

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:57.110
There are no crimes in there.

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:58.844
It's called "I Am Part
of the Resistance

00:02:58.844 --> 00:03:00.312
Inside the Trump
Administration,"

00:03:00.312 --> 00:03:01.981
not "I Am Part
of the Resistance

00:03:01.981 --> 00:03:03.483
Inside the Trump Administration,

00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:04.784
and Also I Murdered a Guy."

00:03:04.784 --> 00:03:06.118
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.118 --> 00:03:08.054
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:12.091 --> 00:03:14.194
The fact is, calling
Donald Trump

00:03:14.194 --> 00:03:16.429
an incompetent moron
is not a crime.

00:03:16.429 --> 00:03:17.897
It's not even new information.

00:03:17.897 --> 00:03:19.165
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.165 --> 00:03:21.700
And yet he's very obviously
freaked out by both

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:24.637
the anonymous op-ed and famed
journalist Bob Woodward's

00:03:24.637 --> 00:03:26.172
blockbuster new book, "Fear."

00:03:26.172 --> 00:03:27.906
He brought it up
repeatedly last week

00:03:27.906 --> 00:03:30.176
and tweeted obsessively
about it again this morning.

00:03:30.176 --> 00:03:32.812 line:0%
&gt;&gt; "The Woodward book
is a joke," he tweeted...

00:03:46.759 --> 00:03:49.495
-Please do that.

00:03:49.495 --> 00:03:52.898
I would love to see you try
to write a book by yourself

00:03:52.898 --> 00:03:55.935
without a ghost writer,
and I mean, a real book,

00:03:55.935 --> 00:03:57.503
not one of your airport books

00:03:57.503 --> 00:03:59.538
because I'm pretty sure
those books

00:03:59.538 --> 00:04:01.574
have exactly one
word on each page.

00:04:01.574 --> 00:04:03.642
[ Laughter ]

00:04:03.642 --> 00:04:06.645
I'm talking an actual book
with chapters and an appendix.

00:04:06.645 --> 00:04:09.348
Of course, if you told Trump
you need an appendix,

00:04:09.348 --> 00:04:11.751
he'd probably say, "Fine,
just take Eric's."

00:04:11.751 --> 00:04:15.254
[ Laughter ]

00:04:15.254 --> 00:04:18.891
I got to say.

00:04:18.891 --> 00:04:22.261
I got to say, I love imagining
Trump sitting at a typewriter

00:04:22.261 --> 00:04:25.231
punching away at the keys
with his stubby meat paws.

00:04:25.231 --> 00:04:28.433
He either types one finger
at a time grandpa-style

00:04:28.433 --> 00:04:30.970
or with palms fully open like
he's playing Whac-A-Mole.

00:04:34.073 --> 00:04:36.309
[ As President Trump ]
Sad.

00:04:36.309 --> 00:04:38.878
[ Laughter ]

00:04:38.878 --> 00:04:40.079
Exclamation point.

00:04:40.079 --> 00:04:41.714
[ Laughter ]

00:04:41.714 --> 00:04:43.549
[ Normal voice ]
Trump has spent the last week

00:04:43.549 --> 00:04:44.883
fixated on these
anonymous leaks

00:04:44.883 --> 00:04:46.251
from inside his own White House

00:04:46.251 --> 00:04:48.888
warning the country
that he's erratic and unstable.

00:04:48.888 --> 00:04:51.324
So he's responding
by going on national TV

00:04:51.324 --> 00:04:53.292
and acting erratic and unstable.

00:04:53.292 --> 00:04:58.497 line:0%
-The latest act of resistance
is the op-ed published

00:04:58.497 --> 00:05:03.436 line:0%
in the failing "New York Times"
by an "anomonous" --

00:05:03.436 --> 00:05:07.974 line:0%
really an "amonmos,"
gutless coward.

00:05:07.974 --> 00:05:10.642
-Hmm.

00:05:10.642 --> 00:05:13.178
Who -- who do you think it was?

00:05:13.178 --> 00:05:14.480
Maybe it's the same person

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:17.016
who replaced your denture
adhesive with Silly Putty?

00:05:17.016 --> 00:05:21.153
[ Laughter ]

00:05:21.153 --> 00:05:24.457
[ As President Trump ]
Anonomomy.

00:05:24.457 --> 00:05:26.024
[ Normal voice ] But it's not
surprising to me

00:05:26.024 --> 00:05:28.093
that Trump wouldn't know how to
pronounce the word "anonymous"

00:05:28.093 --> 00:05:29.929
since he's never done anything
anonymously in his life.

00:05:29.929 --> 00:05:31.864
If he had been
the Gossip Girl,

00:05:31.864 --> 00:05:34.901
he would have signed the notes
"XOXO, Donald J. Trump."

00:05:34.901 --> 00:05:36.235
[ Laughter ]

00:05:36.235 --> 00:05:39.638
But this...this is one
of the most surreal aspects

00:05:39.638 --> 00:05:41.040
of the moment we're in.

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:43.909
The President of the United
States regularly has to go on TV

00:05:43.909 --> 00:05:46.979
and try to convince people
that he's not out of his mind.

00:05:46.979 --> 00:05:49.715
In fact, last week he just
straight up asked his supporters

00:05:49.715 --> 00:05:51.584
to tell him that he's good
at his job.

00:05:51.584 --> 00:05:54.720 line:0%
-I beat all these Senators,
all these governors,

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:57.190 line:0%
all these brilliant
political minds.

00:05:57.190 --> 00:05:59.558 line:0%
Then I beat the other side.

00:05:59.558 --> 00:06:01.394 line:0%
And then I listened.

00:06:01.394 --> 00:06:02.528 line:0%
"Is he competent?"

00:06:02.528 --> 00:06:04.797 line:0%
I think I'm pretty competent,
right?

00:06:04.797 --> 00:06:05.998 line:0%
Don't you think so?

00:06:05.998 --> 00:06:07.099
-As a general rule,

00:06:07.099 --> 00:06:08.801
it's never good
when you're the President

00:06:08.801 --> 00:06:10.536
and you have to go on TV

00:06:10.536 --> 00:06:14.339
and ask your supporters,
"Do you think I'm competent?"

00:06:14.339 --> 00:06:17.977
If I was about to go under
and my surgeon said to me,

00:06:17.977 --> 00:06:19.978
"Do you think I'm competent?"

00:06:19.978 --> 00:06:23.115
I'd say, "You know what?
I'll keep the gallstones."

00:06:23.115 --> 00:06:24.817
[ Laughter ]

00:06:24.817 --> 00:06:26.318
Trump also argued that years
from now,

00:06:26.318 --> 00:06:28.220
his speeches would be viewed
favorably by history,

00:06:28.220 --> 00:06:29.755
drawing a parallel with
Abraham Lincoln

00:06:29.755 --> 00:06:31.457
that made absolutely no sense.

00:06:31.457 --> 00:06:36.295 line:0%
-When Abraham Lincoln made
the Gettysburg Address speech,

00:06:36.295 --> 00:06:37.897 line:0%
the great speech,

00:06:37.897 --> 00:06:39.899 line:0%
do you know
he was ridiculed?

00:06:39.899 --> 00:06:41.233 line:0%
He was ridiculed.

00:06:41.233 --> 00:06:45.938 line:0%
He went up to Gettysburg
and he delivered that speech --

00:06:45.938 --> 00:06:50.376 line:0%
the Gettysburg Address --
and he was excoriated

00:06:50.376 --> 00:06:51.643 line:0%
by the fake news.

00:06:51.643 --> 00:06:53.012 line:0%
They had fake news.

00:06:53.012 --> 00:06:54.746 line:0%
He was excoriated.

00:06:54.746 --> 00:06:58.784 line:0%
They said it was a terrible,
terrible speech.

00:06:58.784 --> 00:07:02.555 line:0%
They said it was far too short.
It's not long.

00:07:02.555 --> 00:07:05.124 line:0%
Many of us know it by memory.

00:07:05.124 --> 00:07:06.926
-No.

00:07:06.926 --> 00:07:10.463
[ Laughter ]

00:07:10.463 --> 00:07:14.099
You do not know the Gettysburg
Address by memory.

00:07:14.099 --> 00:07:17.336
I doubt you know your own
address by memory.

00:07:17.336 --> 00:07:19.071
[ Laughter ]

00:07:19.071 --> 00:07:20.739
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:20.739 --> 00:07:24.843
[ As President Trump ]
It's...

00:07:24.843 --> 00:07:26.245
Yeah, three large pizzas.

00:07:26.245 --> 00:07:29.014
It's a white house.

00:07:29.014 --> 00:07:32.585
It's just a big, white house.

00:07:32.585 --> 00:07:34.787
[ Normal voice ] So now Trump's
White House is engaged

00:07:34.787 --> 00:07:36.255
in an aggressive attempt
to hunt down and expose

00:07:36.255 --> 00:07:39.058
the leakers in his government
who think he's out of his mind

00:07:39.058 --> 00:07:40.659
and they've reportedly
considered

00:07:40.659 --> 00:07:41.693
some extreme measures.

00:07:41.693 --> 00:07:43.162 line:0%
-Advisors to the President

00:07:43.162 --> 00:07:45.197 line:0%
are considering
all their options,

00:07:45.197 --> 00:07:47.600 line:0%
including the idea
of a lie-detector test.

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:50.669
-You want Trump staffers
to take lie-detector tests?

00:07:50.669 --> 00:07:53.172
That thing's going to start
freaking out

00:07:53.172 --> 00:07:55.741
as soon as you get it
inside the building.

00:07:55.741 --> 00:07:59.678
Bringing a lie-detector test
inside this White House

00:07:59.678 --> 00:08:03.315
is like bringing a Geiger
counter to Chernobyl.

00:08:03.315 --> 00:08:05.084
All right.
Let's start with you, Kellyanne.

00:08:05.084 --> 00:08:06.252
[ Geiger counter clicking ]

00:08:06.252 --> 00:08:07.920
No, uh, let's start with you,
John Kelly.

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:09.321
[ Geiger counter clicking ]

00:08:09.321 --> 00:08:10.489
You know what? Let's just start
with the President.

00:08:10.489 --> 00:08:13.192
[ Geiger counter clicking,
explosion ]

00:08:13.192 --> 00:08:14.393
[ Laughter ]

00:08:14.393 --> 00:08:16.395
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:19.899 --> 00:08:22.134 line:0%
We have a paranoid President
who's demanding investigations

00:08:22.134 --> 00:08:23.435 line:0%
of his critics.

00:08:23.435 --> 00:08:25.804 line:0%
If you were looking for
the Constitutional crisis,

00:08:25.804 --> 00:08:27.106 line:0%
it's here.

00:08:27.106 --> 00:08:28.740
It's being aided and abetted
by people whose names

00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:30.576
we don't even know,
people who are --

00:08:30.576 --> 00:08:32.945
-Anomonous.

00:08:32.945 --> 00:08:34.246
-This has been been
"A Closer Look."

00:08:34.246 --> 00:08:37.216
[ Applause ]

